<title>USA: Anthem completes Acordia acquisition.</title>
<headline>Anthem completes Acordia acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anthem Insurance Cos Inc announced today that it has completed acquisition of insurance brokerage firm Acordia Inc.</p>
<p>The deal was completed with the merger of its wholly-owned subsidiary AICI Acquisition Corp into Acordia after a $40 a share tender offer for Acordia, Anthem said.</p>
<p>Anthem continues to be in discussions with a third party financial buyer with regard to a possible sale of the brokerage operations of Acordia, anthem said.</p>
<p>	 ((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
